 ('Which year is associated with the victory described?','1971',['1952','1947','1990'],42,'The passage associates the victory after the war with 1971.'),
 ('How does the passage say the day begins?','With a 31-gun salute at dawn',['With a midnight cricket match','With shops closing for a month','With a river race at noon'],42,'This is the ceremonial description in the passage, not a verified schedule for every year.'),
